      "criterion": "WHEN read models (SessionSummaryReadModel, SessionDetailReadModel, FindingReadModel, ToolCallReadModel, RollupReadModel) are serialized via ReadContractEnvelope<T>, THE SYSTEM SHALL produce JSON validating against schemas/read-contracts/v1.schema.json (type, required fields, and additionalProperties: false only — JSON Schema has no key-ordering construct; key ordering is instead verified by a separate golden-file byte-for-byte comparison test), with contract_version supplied by the envelope. This in-repo schema is the read contract's source of truth; any external consumer (including a future Mac app) validates against it, not the reverse.",
